  "decompilation_defects_corrected": [
    "the Ghidra decompilation renders the case five arm as the NOT then AND form, which reads as clearing bit three. The live path at 0x0043ba37 is MOV EAX,1 / TEST EAX,EAX / JZ 0x0043ba75, so ZF is always zero and the fallthrough OR arm at 0x0043ba69 is the only executed path; case five raises bit three and never clears. The same shape repeats at 0x0043bb0a MOV EAX,1 / 0x0043bb0f TEST EAX,EAX / 0x0043bb11 JZ 0x0044bb48 with the live OR at 0x0043bb3c. The dead NOT at 0x0043ba98 with AND at 0x0043baa0 and the dead NOT at 0x0043bb6b with AND at 0x0043bb73 are unreachable.",
    "the decompilation omits the two byte comparisons of the mirror test and shows only the four byte comparison; the corrected model compares the mark byte, then the tag byte, then the four applied bytes",
    "the shift count guards at 0x0043ba32 and 0x0043bb05 compare EDX against 0x20 with JNC and the index is three, so both fall through"
  ],
